otivating for you to keep chasing your dreams.\"; Calvin: such moments remind him why he got into music — making a difference and sharing his own story — the positive feedback gives him strength to reach more people, \"My journey's just getting started!\"; Dave: \"Wow, Calvin! You've come a long way since we started talking music. What's next for you? Anything exciting coming up?\"; Calvin: \"Lots of cool stuff happening. Next up, a tour - so excited! After that, I'm off to explore and grow my brand. Can't wait to see what the future has in store!\" (tour and brand details in ## Music); Dave: \"Wow, Calvin! Congrats on the upcoming tour! Can't wait to see you perform. Do you have any cities or venues in mind?\" — Calvin did not answer that question in this exchange [S18T1][S18T2][S18T3][S18T4][S18T5][S18T6][S18T7][S18T8].","text_sha256":"c40f40b300ce79ff377244a726d4e2ce1acef27c6ffb85e489bce86b82a8df51","timestamp":"2023-09-13T10:56:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","pre_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":888,"filesystem_tool_calls":4,"model_calls":5,"orchestration_calls":3,"prompt_tokens":120457,"provider_request_attempts":5,"provider_rounds":5,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":121345},"model":{"requested_model":"x-test-2","served_models":["deepseek-v4.1-flash"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"56a7ee328b702acf677218605c2d649afe0089eda09165e5aadb286969116965","filesystem_tools_sha256":"6d9d68f047917d20adb9133168d5726233c9719dbefd54627e08827832d963c6","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3506af86ae75acd7ce07f88bae7a25e1bfec56a5b1c9f44abd3d71a2e6f4eb2d","paper_prompt_id":"filesystem-appendix-a3-prompt-5-normalized-v1","paper_prompt_sha256":"de03315ff999a8bcea7e08a10866f3a6dc74badf690d23a036e35c74ff81335c"},"protocol_version":"shared-evidence-bundle-v1","question":{"co